# Normalisasi line-ending: paksa LF di repo untuk semua file teks.
# Menghilangkan noise CRLF<->LF saat bekerja di Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# File biner: jangan pernah diubah line-ending-nya.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
